1. Purpose

Windy is made available during its public beta period so that users can inspect,
build, run, evaluate, and provide feedback on the software before a broader
release decision is made.

This is a source-available beta license. It is not an open source license as
defined by the Open Source Initiative.

2. Permitted Use

You may:

- View, clone, and download this repository.
- Build and run Windy for your own personal or internal evaluation.
- Modify Windy for your own personal or internal evaluation.
- Create and publish a fork on GitHub or similar source-hosting services solely
  for evaluation, review, or submitting pull requests to the upstream
  repository.
- Submit issues, feedback, and pull requests to the upstream repository.
- Share short excerpts of the code or documentation for discussion, review, or
  issue reporting, provided that you preserve attribution.

